  "text": "Antiques Atlas\n\nAntiques for Sale  |  Antique Furniture  |  Antique Fairs  |  Antiques Listings  |  Antiques Email Alerts  | Websites for Antique Dealers  | Contact\n\nBridgend Antiques\n\nTel : 02893341979, Mobile: 07966751699\nEmail : [REDACTED_EMAIL]\nWeb : https://www.youtube.com/shorts/iet95Lq8_NQ\nWeb : www.antiques-atlas.com/bridgendantiques/\n\n50 Church Road\nBallynure\nBallyclare, Co Antrim\nNorthern Ireland BT39 9UF\nOpen: Monday - Saturday 10.30am - 5.30pm or by appointment.\n\n \n  \nVictorian Brass Coal Scuttle - Coal Helmet\nprevious\nnext\nPhotos\nDescription\nVictorian Embossed Brass Coal Scuttle, with ebonised and brass turned handle, leaf scroll supports and hinged cover embossed with flowers, leaves and roundels, complete with original shovel, raised on circular base, all in excellent condition ready to place in your home.\n\nDimensions are Approx. To extreme points.19\" High 18\" Wide 13\" Deep.\n\nPlease contact us for more details.\nDate\nVictorian : C 1870\nCondition\nEXCELLENT\nCode\nas619a364 / P 448\nPrice\nSOLD\nStatus\nSold\nSeller\nBridgend Antiques\nTelephone\n07966751699\nNon UK callers :\n+44 7966751699\nEmail\[REDACTED_EMAIL]\nContact\n\nSend Bridgend Antiques a message about this item here\n\nYour Name\n\n\nYour Email Address\n\n\nYour Telephone Number\n\n\n\nYour Location\n\n\n\nYour Message\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nFor information on how we deal with your data please see our Privacy policy.\n\n\n \nAntiques Atlas\nJanuary, 2015\nHome\nContact\n\n\n\n  Catalogue\nView All\nAntique Clocks\nArt / Paintings\nBarometers\nAntique Boxes\nBronzes\nCeramics\nDesk Accessories\nFireplace Decor\nFurniture\nPost 1940 Furniture\nGarden Antiques\nGlass\nJewellery\nKitchenalia\nLighting\nMedical\nMetalware\nMirrors\nNatural History\nNautical Antiques\nSilver Plated\nSilver\nTaxidermy\nTreen\nVintage Vanity\nWalking Sticks & Canes\nBridgend Antiques, 2026\n© Antiques Atlas     Website terms and condtions",
